# Offizier lead (M6, D-096, lead = true): the flag bearer of the file. The
# same officer as `offizier` (same hitbox, anims and poses), plus a thin
# staff l with a Y/o finial and a small black-and-yellow flag (k outline):
# the Kaiserfahne, a Y/o field with a dark d eagle blot. Above row 10 the flag uses only columns
# 0-1, so it ends >= 2 px left of the 8 px sabre zone (columns 4-11).
# march: flag up behind the shako, the cloth flutters. habtacht: the flag
# dips (staff lowered back past the hip). praesentiert: the staff stands up
# tall, finial at row 2, cloth spread; the sabre is drawn as for `offizier`.
# squished: the flag lies on the ground behind him.
# Faces right; mirror = auto. Built with the same scratch script.
sprite = offizier_lead
size   = 16x32
origin = 8,32
hitbox = 2,10,12,22
mirror = auto
anim   = march        frames=2 ticks=8 loop
anim   = habtacht     frames=1
anim   = praesentiert frames=1
anim   = squished     frames=1
